# Opt-in memory repairs and NX_MEM_TRACE accounting; guard remains 8 GiB.
astral-windows-mem.patch
astral-windows-perf.patch
astral-windows-resident.patch
astral-windows-writeback.patch
astral-windows-replay.patch

# QPC diagnostics and opt-in pacing/ASTC experiments; Unicode data-root support.
